<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Chordal Tolerancing</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Polylines &gt; Sampling &gt; Chordal Tolerancing</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span class="Command">Chordal Tolerancing</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command is the process of following a line and representing it by a polyline with the minimum number of points that will not deviate from the original line by more than the defined error tolerance.</span></p>
<p><img src="../Processing_Polylines_files/image009.gif" width="257px" height="165px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tolerance</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Maximum error tolerance for line deviation. Default tolerance for this command is 0.01mm.</span></p>
<span lang="EN-GB"><img src="processing_polylines_files/image010.gif" width="545px" height="244px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></span>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is grayed if there is no polyline selection or all selections are hidden. It affects the entire polyline, no matter if it is wholly or partially selected.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Example</u></span></a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP164718366" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs6">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td class="whs8">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="processing_polylines_files/image012.jpg" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs10">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="processing_polylines_files/image014.jpg" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td class="whs11">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Polyline before applying Chordal Tolerancing</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs12">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Polyline after applying Chordal Tolerancing (0.5mm)</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
<p class="Use"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Chordal Tolerancing</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to reduce the number of points in the selected polylines while maintaining the accuracy. This may be done before exporting to reduce the file size.</span></p>
